    "faq": {
      "type": "cb-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "q_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Email us at info@casbasics.com or message us through the chat at the bottom of the page with your order number, and we’ll update you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I receive an abaya sooner?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our ready-to-wear pieces are already made and are dispatched within 1–2 days. You’ll find them in the Ready to Wear collection, marked \"RTW\" in the name.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will my order take?",
            "answer": "<p>Made-to-measure abayas arrive within 12–15 days of your order.</p><p>If 15 days have passed and your order hasn’t arrived, message us on WhatsApp or email info@casbasics.com with your full name and phone number. We’ll come back to you within 24 hours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which fabrics are best for warm weather?",
            "answer": "<p>For warm days and everyday wear, choose a lighter fabric. <strong>Nada</strong>, <strong>Crepe</strong> and <strong>Chiffon</strong> are light and breathable, and <strong>Linen</strong> is made for summer: natural, airy and durable. Each keeps you cool without compromising on elegance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which customisations are available?",
            "answer": "<p>Most customisations are <strong>complimentary</strong>. We tailor every abaya to your size, from XS to 3XL, and to any length up to 63″. You can also add buttons to the front or sleeves, choose a zip or button closure (thoughtful for nursing mothers), add pockets, choose your neckline, or remove our logo from the abaya or shayla.</p><p>A few additions carry a small fee: a full lining (batana) is AED 70, an extra chiffon layer is AED 100, and a longer shayla is AED 40. We’ll always confirm any charge before your order is finalised.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I make changes to an abaya?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Message our team on <a href=\"https://wa.me/971585959872\" title=\"WhatsApp\">WhatsApp</a> to talk through the changes you’d like.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your exchange policy?",
            "answer": "<p>Exchanges are accepted within 7 days of delivery, for pieces that are unworn and in their original condition (terms apply). Please read our full <a href=\"/pages/exchange-refund-policy\" title=\"Exchange policy\">exchange policy</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which fabrics do you offer, and which suit which occasion?",
            "answer": "<p>For everyday wear, <strong>Nada</strong> is soft and light, and <strong>Crepe</strong> is comfortable and breathable with a gentle drape. <strong>Chiffon</strong> is airy and usually layered. For work or formal occasions, <strong>Jacquard</strong> and <strong>Soft Jacquard</strong> bring texture and structure. For weddings and evenings, <strong>Bridal Satin</strong> has a subtle sheen and <strong>Dantel lace</strong> adds intricate detail. <strong>Velvet</strong>, <strong>Suede</strong> and <strong>Tweed</strong> are our winter fabrics, and <strong>Linen</strong> is for summer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I make sure my abaya fits?",
            "answer": "<p>Made-to-measure abayas are cut to your measurements. We work from garment measurements rather than body measurements, so the easiest way is to measure an abaya you already love: chest, hips, length, sleeve from the neck and shoulder, in inches. We also offer standard sizes from XS to 3XL, in any length. If anything isn’t right after delivery, our team will help with an alteration or replacement.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_10": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I send my measurements?",
            "answer": "<p>Send us your measurements in inches: chest, hips, abaya length, sleeve length (from the neck) and shoulder width. Measuring a similar abaya gives the most accurate result. <a href=\"/pages/abaya-size-chart\" title=\"Size guide\">See our size guide</a>.</p><p>Made-to-measure abayas arrive within 12–15 days of your order. Need it sooner? Our ready-to-wear pieces are dispatched within 1–2 days.</p>"
          }
        }
